# Frontend build configuration.
#
# Leave empty to call the API on the same origin (/api), which is what the
# Vercel deployment does: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the API container, so
# the HttpOnly auth cookies stay first-party. Vite inlines this value at build
# time, so change it and rebuild.
#
# Only set this to point a build straight at a cross-origin API:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api
VITE_API_URL=
